#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktables-scripts.md
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Documentation for darktable's scripts is available in the [lua docs](https://docs.darktable.org/lua/stable/lua.scripts.manual/scripts/).\n"
