#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/sidecar-files/sidecar-import.md
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "In addition, darktable has been designed to help migrate some image operations from other specific applications. The aim here is not to make darktable a drop-in replacement for any other software, but rather to help you to recover part of the work you have already invested into your image. It is important to understand that the import process will never give identical results to other software. The underlying processing engines are very different from application to application, and depend a lot on the individual image. In some cases, the results may be similar but often, further adjustment will be required in darktable.\n"
msgstr "In addition, darktable has been designed பெறுநர் உதவி migrate some படம் operations இருந்து மற்றொன்று specific applications. The aim here is not பெறுநர் make darktable a drop-in மாற்று க்கு any மற்றொன்று software, but rather பெறுநர் உதவி you பெறுநர் recover part of the வேலை you have already invested into your image. It is important பெறுநர் understand that the இறக்குமதி process will ஒருபோதும் give identical முடிவுகள் பெறுநர் மற்றொன்று software. The underlying processing engines அரே very different இருந்து application பெறுநர் application, and depend a நிறைய on the individual image. In some cases, the முடிவுகள் சி-வைகாசி be similar but often, further adjustment will be required in darktable.\n"

