#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-dimensions.md
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![sRGB-red](./color-dimensions/sRGB-red.png)\n"
"![sRGB-green](./color-dimensions/sRGB-green.png)\n"
