#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/performance-and-troubleshooting.md
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Run darktable from a terminal with `darktable -d ai` to see ONNX Runtime load messages and provider probe results. Typical causes:\n"
