#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "**`ort_library_path` points at a missing or corrupt file.** Reset the path in preferences (double-click the label) to fall back to the bundled runtime, or re-run _detect_ after re-installing via the [GPU install scripts](../gpu-acceleration/).\n"
