#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"preset list\n"
": A list of the presets available for the current module. The currently selected preset (if any) is shown in **bold** and with a small check mark beside it. In addition, if the selected preset displays on a submenu, it parent entry is also highlighted in **bold**.\n"
