#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-brightness-saturation.md
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "**Please note that this module is [deprecated](../../darkroom/processing-modules/deprecated.md) from darktable 4.4 and should no longer be used for new edits. Please use the [_color balance rgb_](./color-balance-rgb.md) module instead.**\n"
