#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"description\n"
": reconstruct full RGB pixels from a sensor color filter array reading.\n"
msgstr ""
"விளக்கம் \n"
